# {{.ProjectName}}

Java service bootstrapped by `gofi init`.

## Layout

```
{{.SourceRoot}}/
├── pom.xml
├── .migrations/
└── src/
    ├── main/java/{{.PackagePath}}/
    │   ├── Application.java
    │   └── domain/          # one package per bounded context
    └── test/java/{{.PackagePath}}/
```

Requires JDK 25: `Application` uses an instance `main()` and `IO.println`.

## Build & run

```sh
java {{.SourceRoot}}/src/main/java/{{.PackagePath}}/Application.java
```

Compiled:

```sh
mvn -q -f {{.SourceRoot}}/pom.xml compile
java -cp {{.SourceRoot}}/target/classes {{.Module}}.Application
```

## Tests

